  "milestone": {
   "id": 145608,
   "title": "Forgejo v18.0.0",
   "description": "\n\n<!--start release-notes-assistant-->\n\n## Release notes\n<!--URL:https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo-->\n- Breaking security features\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14148): <!--number 14148 --><!--line 0 --><!--description -->Move internal communication to UNIX socket. The `INTERNAL_TOKEN` can now be dropped from the configuration, the UNIX socket path and permissions can be configured using the `INTERNAL_LISTENER_PATH` and `INTERNAL_LISTENER_PERMISSIONS` options. This change removes the `./forgejo generate secret INTERNAL_TOKEN` command and updates the contrib Forgejo systemd unit file.<br>See the [documentation](https://forgejo.org/docs/latest/admin/config-cheat-sheet/#server-server) for more information.<!--description-->\n- User Interface features\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14536): <!--number 14536 --><!--line 0 --><!--description bWFrZSBkcm9wZG93bnMgZGlhbG9nLWJhc2VkIHdpdGggdmFyaW91cyBpbXByb3ZlbWVudHM=-->make dropdowns dialog-based with various improvements<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14158): <!--number 14158 --><!--line 0 --><!--description YWNjZXNzaWJsZSBhcmlhLWxhYmVscyAmIHdvcmtpbmcgY29tbWl0IGRlc2NyaXB0aW9uIHRvZ2dsZXMgdy9vIEpT-->accessible aria-labels & working commit description toggles w/o JS<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14522): <!--number 14522 --><!--line 0 --><!--description ZGlzYWJsZSB0ZXh0IHdyYXBwaW5nIGluIGNvZGUgYmxvY2tz-->disable text wrapping in code blocks<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13517): <!--number 13517 --><!--line 0 --><!--description YXV0aDogc3RhcnQgb2F1dGgyIGxvZ2luIGlmIGl0cyB0aGUgb25seSBhdmFpbGFibGUgbG9naW4=-->auth: start oauth2 login if its the only available login<!--description-->\n- User Interface bug fixes\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14435): <!--number 14435 --><!--line 0 --><!--description Rml4IGljb25zIGluIG1pbGVzdG9uZSBhbmQgcHJvamVjdCBtZXRhZGF0YSBub3QgYmVpbmcgY29uc2lzdGVudCB3aXRoIGhvdyBpY29ucyBhcmUgdXNlZCBlbHNld2hlcmUgb24gRm9yZ2Vqbw==-->Fix icons in milestone and project metadata not being consistent with how icons are used elsewhere on Forgejo<!--description-->\n- Features\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14386): <!--number 14386 --><!--line 0 --><!--description ZmVhdChsZnMpOiBhZGQgbGZzIGZpbGUgc3VwcG9ydCB0byAvcmVuZGVyIGVuZHBvaW50-->feat(lfs): add lfs file support to /render endpoint<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13023): <!--number 13023 --><!--line 0 --><!--description YWRkIGNvZGUgc3VnZ2VzdGlvbg==-->add code suggestion<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14117): <!--number 14117 --><!--line 0 --><!--description dGVhbSBtZW1iZXJzaGlwIHByb3ZlbmFuY2UgdHJhY2tpbmc=-->team membership provenance tracking<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14505): <!--number 14505 --><!--line 0 --><!--description ZmVhdChmZWVkKTogcGFyc2UgYW5kIHNldCBsaW1pdCBwYXJhbWV0ZXIgZm9yIHJlbGVhc2UgZmVlZCByZXF1ZXN0-->feat(feed): parse and set limit parameter for release feed request<!--description-->\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14164): <!--number 14164 --><!--line 0 --><!--description ZmVhdChjbWQpOiBhbGxvdyBwYXNzd29yZCB0byBiZSByZWFkIGZyb20gc3RkaW4=-->feat(cmd): allow password to be read from stdin<!--description-->\n- User Interface changes without a feature or bug label\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14598): <!--number 14598 --><!--line 0 --><!--description c29ydCB1c2VyIHJlcG9zaXRvcmllcyBpbiBwYWNrYWdlIGxpbmtpbmcsIG1ha2UgaW5wdXQgc2VhcmNoYWJsZQ==-->sort user repositories in package linking, make input searchable<!--description-->\n- Other changes without a feature or bug label\n  - [PR](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14621): <!--number 14621 --><!--line 0 --><!--description ZGVsZXRpbmcgYSB1c2VyIHcvIHJlcG8tc3BlY2lmaWMgYWNjZXNzIH